{"3840340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DeTails", "steam_appid": 3840340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/bc78620f7dcb53b081c0ed0ac840b274.poster.avif?t=1787627699\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/bc78620f7dcb53b081c0ed0ac840b274.mp4?t=1787627699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is a punk-powered adventure about The HEXES as they travel around Long Den on their first ever tour. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something strange is happening at the location of each venue, colourless voids are disrupting normal life and someone has been kidnapping the local mole population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.poster.avif?t=1787627699\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.webm?t=1787627699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.mp4?t=1787627699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant world of rebellion, freedom, friendship and growing up without losing your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Long Den, a visually stunning 2D/3D world oozing with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a whole host of local weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use colour to change the environment and solve puzzles or just ruin someone's day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the pigs and make your mark with the graffiti ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mini games like high-speed downhill racing and crowd rocking bass playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is set to an exciting and atmospheric punk and alternative soundtrack featuring real artists.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/19d64667e6dd1d38d736328a08aef637.poster.avif?t=1787627699\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/19d64667e6dd1d38d736328a08aef637.webm?t=1787627699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/19d64667e6dd1d38d736328a08aef637.mp4?t=1787627699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/bc78620f7dcb53b081c0ed0ac840b274.poster.avif?t=1787627699\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/bc78620f7dcb53b081c0ed0ac840b274.mp4?t=1787627699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is a punk-powered adventure about The HEXES as they travel around Long Den on their first ever tour. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something strange is happening at the location of each venue, colourless voids are disrupting normal life and someone has been kidnapping the local mole population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.poster.avif?t=1787627699\" width=1170 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.webm?t=1787627699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840340/extras/41a48ea9c89adf407206600f6eb6a5de.mp4?t=1787627699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant world of rebellion, freedom, friendship and growing up without losing your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Long Den, a visually stunning 2D/3D world oozing with character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a whole host of local weirdos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use colour to change the environment and solve puzzles or just ruin someone's day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the pigs and make your mark with the graffiti ability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master mini games like high-speed downhill racing and crowd rocking bass playing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DeTails</i> is set to an exciting and atmospheric punk and alternative soundtrack featuring real artists.  </p><p clas